type: software
title: "pse-opendata: Python client for the public data of PSE, the Polish transmission system operator"
abstract: >-
  An unofficial Python client for the public data of PSE S.A., the Polish transmission system operator: the
  reports API (market prices RCE and SDAC, demand and generation, the balancing market, cross-border flows and
  redispatch of renewables) and the legacy CSV export with the history before June 2024. It returns tidy pandas
  frames with explicit interval start and end times in UTC and Polish local time, caches monthly Parquet files
  with per-report revision windows and handles the pitfalls of the sources: interval-end time stamps, daylight
  saving days, hourly products repeated in quarter-hours, republished settlement data, rate limits and keyset
  paging that skips repeated balancing capacity offers. Not affiliated with PSE S.A.
